{
  "bookId": "rewind-9",
  "id": "chapter-42",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "4750001",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "洛瑞丝！你知道你刚刚做什么？！！你对绿子做了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "不要责怪她……是我让她这么做的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "只有这样大家才能活下去……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "里惠·实习天使",
          "text": "为什么，为什么会变成这样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750005",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "洛瑞丝注意你的右手边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "嗯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "蓝莎·海恩！你为什么可以做到什么反应都没有，你这个冷血的家伙！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "如果你们还要在这里争执下去，我们所有人现在都会死亡。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "源上",
          "text": "真是有趣的发展。你面对为了救你们而死的朋友，竟然毫不动容，不愧是杰克教授看上的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水咲",
          "text": "和她废话什么，快上。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "哈莉，你是士兵，你明白。死去的人很重要，但活着的人同样重要。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "把你所有的憎恨、痛苦都化作消灭敌人的力量，保护绿子的成果。如果你们真的珍惜绿子的话。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750013",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "混蛋！混蛋混蛋！！！！！！！蓝莎·海恩，我总有一天会杀了你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "嗯，我等着你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小红",
          "text": "哈莉我来帮你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "里惠·实习天使",
          "text": "那我呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "这些混蛋交给我，你保护好绿子……保护好她的躯体。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "里惠·实习天使",
          "text": "嗯，不怕，绿子你不要怕……我们会保护你……呜呜呜……为什么会这样……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "注意戒备，敌人正在重新集合。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "好的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "收起你的笑容。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "难得看到你生气。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4750023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "你左边，我负责右边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-277",
